      <Output>
        <StdOut>JOURNEY-GAP: the CONSUMER employee-ordering surface (payer strip, eligibility state, the CompanyAccount payment option, reduce-or-switch) is a separate consumer-app lane. The backend attribution seam it drives — quote → CartService.PromoteToOrder(CompanyAccount) bind → capture — is proven end-to-end in MealsPilotFullLoopJourneyTests and MealsOrderLoopJourneyTests.</StdOut>
      </Output>
